## Key Files

```
Capitalisman/
├── CLAUDE.md.ref              <- this file
├── app.py                     <- Streamlit entrypoint + sidebar navigation
├── ui/                        <- page modules (page_predict.py, page_backtest.py, ...)
├── signals/                   <- signal generation + combiner (BUY/SELL/HOLD logic)
├── indicators/                <- technical indicator computation
├── backtesting/               <- backtest engine
├── ml/                        <- TimesFM runtime + benchmark (optional)
├── config/                    <- settings.py + overrides.py
├── data/                      <- fetched/cached market data
├── scripts/                   <- utility scripts
├── tests/                     <- pytest suite (+ conftest.py)
├── docs/ / README.md / ROADMAP.md  <- friend's original documentation
├── database/
│   └── tickets.db             <- auto-created by simplex_mind ticket system (gitignored)
└── testing/                   <- manual test checklists
```

